<title>AUSTRALIA: Australis shares to be reinstated - ASX.</title>
<headline>Australis shares to be reinstated - ASX.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australis Media Ltd shares are to be reinstated on the Australian Stock Exchange (ASX) at 12.14 p.m. (0214) on Tuesday, the ASX said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Australis shares were suspended on Monday following Friday's merger announcement with fellow pay-television group Foxtel.  </p>
<p>Foxtel is equally owned by The News Corp Ltd and state-owned telecommunications group Telstra Corp </p>
<p>Australis shares last traded on Friday, when they closed steady at 18.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
